WEBVTT

20:10.861 --> 20:12.988
Oh, this heat.

20:13.113 --> 20:15.908
On days like this,
I envy you northerners,

20:16.033 --> 20:18.827
your summer snows.
Until tomorrow, my lord.

20:18.952 --> 20:21.580
I've been hoping
to talk to you about Jon Arryn.

20:22.706 --> 20:24.416
Lord Arryn?

20:24.541 --> 20:29.087
Oh, his death was
a great sadness to all of us.

20:29.213 --> 20:34.259
I took personal charge of his care,
but I could not save him.
